and we will now try to find and fix those

6
00:00:16,312 --> 00:00:18,927
errors. And along the way, I will share some

7
00:00:19,039 --> 00:00:21,509
hints at how you can approach this, how you

8
00:00:21,509 --> 00:00:24,204
can find and fix errors you might be facing

9
00:00:24,252 --> 00:00:27,605
